# Hands-on 1 is fully offline and needs nothing from this file.
# Hands-on 2 (LLM-as-judge) and the red-team demo call the live model via
# OpenRouter and need a key.
#
# In the workshop the key arrives as a Codespaces secret — nothing to do.
# Locally:  cp .env.example .env  and fill it in (Bun loads `.env` itself).
#
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys and put a spending limit on it:
# a full judge run plus a red-team run costs a few cents.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
